Z||000000||JohnnyK||08-21-2001||01:50 AM||||Ok, I go to this bar that I hate because my friends wanted to go tonight (they always go there), and we sit down, and my friend has one more bite of his pita to go. The bartender comes over, "You can't eat that in here!" "Why not" "Cause it's outside food" "So?! Theres no one in here" "If you go to swiss chalet, will they let you eat a burger?" "Probably if there is no one in the restaurant" So anyways, my friend obliges, goes outside and eats his pita. We're sitting down, and this older man (the manager) walks by, looks at my other friend, and goes "******* " pretty quietly, and we're all like "Wha?" and he leaves for a few minutes, and then comes and sits down, and my buddy is like "You just called me an ******* !" "No i didnt'" "Yes, you did, I saw it in your eyes, you looked right at me" and he starts saying real sarcastically "Yeah, the eyes! The Eyes!" And then he looks at my other friend and goes "Your the *******  who brought outside food in here!" and then he looks at me, and my leg was shaking up and down (I do that, you know, like most fidgity people) and goes "You need some vitamin B there, Dolomite" (wha? I'm a 70's black detective?) and then he turns to my other friend and go "What? You need a parent?" And my friend is like "I have 2" "yeah, don't we all" And then the manager says "Yeah, i'm a big ****ing rebel!" And starts doing the wackoff motion.. So we're just like "We're leaving.. Screw you" and we head, and then he stops my friend at the door (By walking right in front of him and not letting him go by) and calls to the bartender "Is this the guy who brought in outside food??". Anyways, my friend said he had an attitude "What attitude?!" "that one". Finally we just walked out.. Man, I had the biggest urge to just sucker punch him and knock him down the stairs (the final "confrontation" happened at the top of the stairs).. Sigh.. But he's a manager and has worked there like 10 years. Nothing I can do eh?||||reg||1
